<p>Summons a small raging volcano for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns. Every turn, it will fire a molten boulder towards up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> of your foes, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">23, 31, 38, 43, 48</acronym> fire and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">23, 31, 38, 43, 48</acronym> physical damage.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>